# 16. Key Takeaways

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **SD-WAN rule = path selection.**
> **Firewall policy = security/access control.**
> **Traffic shaper = bandwidth control.**
> **DSCP = traffic classification / QoS marking.**
> **SLA = path quality measurement.**
> **Routing table / FIB = determines available forwarding paths.**

### Mental Model

```text
Traffic
   |
   v
Firewall Policy
   |
   +---- Application Identification
   +---- Security Decision
   |
   v
SD-WAN Rule
   |
   +---- Source / Destination
   +---- DSCP / TOS
   +---- Application
   +---- SLA
   +---- Strategy
   |
   v
Routing / FIB
   |
   v
WAN Member
   |
   v
Traffic Shaper / QoS
   |
   v
Internet / VPN / Remote Site
```
